Begin3
Title:          Dr. Mind
Version:        1.0
Entered-date:   2019-08-30
Description:    PC adaptation of a well-known board game.
Summary:        Dr. Mind is a PC adaptation of a well-known board game. The computer generates a secret color code, and the player has to figure out the exact pattern within 8 turns. After each turn, the computer provides clues about how many colors matched the solution. The game features a set of 24 pictures that are initially blurred - every time you work out a valid code combination, you are rewarded with a picture. This game is published under the CC BY-ND 4.0 license, which is roughly equivalent to "freeware with source code".
Keywords:       mind,mastermind,games
Author:         Mateusz Viste
Maintained-by:  Mateusz Viste
Primary-site:   http://drmind.sourceforge.net
Original-site:  http://drmind.sourceforge.net
Platforms:      DOS
